Each conclusion was read for every disjunct: NONE of these conclusions contains an escape disjunction. Existentials below name a concrete derivation, successor, relation or recorded evidence; none is an unbounded collision predicate. Concrete examples are affirmative/negative tests, not universal theorems with impossible hypotheses. Existing landed signatures remain byte-identical. No independent reader is claimed.
- WorldsField.derives_in_model: arbitrary reduct derivation maps into any model; conclusion is membership, requires real rule-closure induction, no escape.
